    "abstract": "<jats:p>Matthew Basilico of Harvard University reviews \u201cMadness and Enterprise: Psychiatry, Economic Reason, and the Emergence of Pathological Value\u201d by Nima Bassiri. The Econlit abstract of this book begins: \u201cExplores how economic reasoning has been adopted by psychiatric clinicians and researchers in order to facilitate diagnostic assessments about potential psychiatric patients on the basis of their apparent economic behaviors, focusing on how economic value came to comprise part of the ontology of madness.\u201d</jats:p>",
